<!-- CI/CD pipeline — Mermaid flow and sequence -->

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Checkout & Cache] --> B[Install deps (npm ci)]
  B --> C[Lint (ESLint)]
  C --> D[Build (tsc, bundling)]
  D --> E{Tests}
  E -->|unit| F[Unit tests (fast)]
  E -->|integration| G[Integration tests (mini-MCP)]
  E -->|e2e| H[E2E (Playwright)]
  F --> I{pass?}
  G --> I
  H --> I
  I -->|all pass| J[Package & Upload Artifacts]
  J --> K[Deploy (staging/prod)]
  K --> L[Smoke + Monitoring]
  I -->|any fail| M[Fail pipeline & notify PR]

  classDef critical fill:#f96,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
  D,F,G,H,J,K critical
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Git as GitHub
  participant CI as Runner
  participant Builder
  Git->>CI: push/PR
  CI->>Builder: install & build
  CI->>Builder: run lint & unit tests
  par parallel test
    Builder->>Builder: run integration tests
    Builder->>Builder: run e2e tests
  end
  alt all pass
    CI->>CI: package artifacts
    CI->>Deploy: deploy to target
    Deploy->>CI: smoke ok
  else any fail
    CI->>Git: report failed checks
  end
```
